- 模型：`gpt-3.5-turbo`（2022 年时期）
- 系统角色：按 Huang et al. (2024) §3.1，有两种变体：(a) "You are an award winning creative short story writer."，(b) "You're writing a Reddit story and you want other reddit users to like and upvote your story."
- 用户写作题目模板："Write a 500 word story for the following prompt: {prompt_text}"（Huang et al. 2024 §3.1）
